---
import { BUSINESS_INFO } from '../../data/businessInfo';
---

<section class="py-12 lg:py-20 bg-surface-canvas border-b border-surface-border">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Column: Logistics Info (7 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink-primary leading-[1.15]">
          Jangkauan Logistik &amp; Perakitan
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-agri-700 tracking-tight">
          Material Bisa Dikirim. Tim Kami Bisa Datang.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed">
          Agrokomplek Cemerlang melayani kebutuhan material dan konstruksi untuk berbagai wilayah Indonesia.
        </p>

        <!-- 2 Workflows -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
          <div class="border border-surface-border bg-surface-card p-5 rounded-lg space-y-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-agri-700 block">
              01 &mdash; PENGIRIMAN MATERIAL
            </span>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-ink-primary">
              Plastik UV &bull; Paranet &bull; Mulsa &bull; Spring Clip &bull; Material Irigasi &bull; Komponen Greenhouse
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
              Kami membantu mengatur pengiriman melalui pilihan ekspedisi dan angkutan sesuai jenis, volume, dan tujuan barang.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="border border-surface-border bg-surface-card p-5 rounded-lg space-y-2">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-agri-700 block">
              02 &mdash; TIM INSTALASI PROYEK
            </span>
            <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
              Untuk proyek yang membutuhkan tenaga aplikator, tim teknisi dapat dijadwalkan untuk membantu proses perakitan di lokasi.
            </p>
            <p class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-agri-700 pt-1">
              Jawa &bull; Sumatera &bull; Kalimantan &bull; Sulawesi &bull; Indonesia Timur
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Action Links -->
        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
          <a
            href="/wilayah-layanan/"
            class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-md bg-agri-700 hover:bg-agri-800 text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors select-none"
          >
            <span>PELAJARI JANGKAUAN LAYANAN</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
          <a
            href={`https://wa.me/${BUSINESS_INFO.contact.whatsappRaw}?text=${encodeURIComponent('Halo Agrokomplek Cemerlang, saya ingin cek ongkir material / layanan perakitan untuk lokasi proyek saya.')}`}
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-md border border-surface-border bg-surface-card hover:bg-surface-subtle text-ink-primary font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors select-none"
          >
            <span>KONSULTASI LOGISTIK WA</span>
            <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Verification Data Box (5 cols) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="border border-surface-border bg-surface-card p-6 rounded-lg space-y-4">
          <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-ink-primary uppercase tracking-wider border-b border-surface-border pb-3">
            STANDAR PENGEMASAN &amp; PENGIRIMAN
          </h3>

          <div class="space-y-4 text-xs text-ink-secondary">
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <span class="font-bold text-ink-primary text-sm uppercase tracking-wider block">
                01 &mdash; Packing Aman
              </span>
              <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
                Rol plastik UV dan material tertentu dikemas dengan perlindungan tambahan untuk membantu mengurangi risiko kerusakan selama perjalanan.
              </p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <span class="font-bold text-ink-primary text-sm uppercase tracking-wider block">
                02 &mdash; Resi &amp; Tracking
              </span>
              <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
                Nomor resi diberikan setelah barang diserahkan kepada pihak ekspedisi.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-1">
              <span class="font-bold text-ink-primary text-sm uppercase tracking-wider block">
                03 &mdash; Panduan Instalasi
              </span>
              <p class="text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
                Untuk pelanggan yang melakukan pemasangan sendiri, tersedia bantuan konsultasi teknis melalui WhatsApp/video call apabila diperlukan.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
